{"v":4,"catch":"設在可折疊紙張世界的拼圖冒險。","desc":"《Paper Trail》是款俯視視角解謎冒險遊戲：在這個萬物皆可摺疊的圖紙世界中，主角將離開自己的故鄉。你將扮演新生代的學者佩吉，首次離開故鄉追求學術知識與研究。在旅途中，你將學會如何摺疊世界、透過摺合圖紙兩端來解謎、探索全新區域並發掘圖紙世界失落已久的秘密。","publisher":"Newfangled Games","release":"2024-05-23","genres":["益智","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文","英文","法文","德文","意大利文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.1GB / Switch 1.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1a8692c6394ecca54d21d4cbd5a1eae812eb7e2e37fee160d9b10ce8631d4243.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/55445a87d4e3a078d58713068d9845d83c06de5e46edd6999a9fa0e0faa2c1a2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8011aade3edf6532e4425986a40a7707bd226426d95eef8f6da92f593a9fef72.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/61f843719c3ed4fc260312c85e175669969ad4074cb779193d5e33468b877198.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cee956bc0f21ad9e35a823bfca2d22c7ab250e9d8ad7ca26ac526ab9b7ba9577.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/65219c283427881b60be99df3d690d1ebc11d70aeec4d04e67b110a5a9235709.jpg"],"titleId":"01006b4017982000","dlc":[]}